-- Deliberately empty.
--
-- This host has the REL loader enabled as a Dolphin Gecko cheat (D86), so every
-- R8PP01 disc runs it -- including one built with no mod at all, which then
-- reports "ERROR: mod.rel was not found". The loader is looking for a file a
-- vanilla disc has no reason to carry.
--
-- So this mod exists to be found and do nothing: a valid mod.rel, an empty
-- entry script, and `"banner": false` so the disc also looks stock. Use it when
-- what you want is the unmodified game on a host that cannot boot one.
--
-- The empty body is safe as of D106. Before it, a script that fell off its end
-- left its evt entry alive and hung the game, which this would have done
-- immediately -- so this file is also the smallest possible regression test for
-- that fix.

script main {
}
